content.text:
The toaster is the stock snippet, so it isn't the cause. The layout can't be exported with the toaster's portal changing the server output, so I'll fix what is mine. The hardcoded `className="dark"` is the most likely cause: `next-themes` rewrites the `<html>` class before hydration, so React sees different markup on the server and the client. I'm removing it and making the theme-dependent label stable. I'm also mounting the mobile menu on the client only.

```tsx app/layout.tsx
